  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "In the figure, \\(\\triangle ABC\\) has a right angle at \\(C\\) and \\(\\angle A=20^\\circ.\\) If \\(BD\\) is the bisector of \\(\\angle ABC,\\) then \\(\\angle BDC=\\)",
